", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1163443652496605_4437736750532399358_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VfSNHfKI7pYQ7kNvwE87y_V&_nc_oc=AdrpEFYnrgZu5WCbr__BoItYU-7Ulw-R22TAa0wZgOBzg1ARYOEZ2NwbG7KWpQHdOGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH3Urm3uGViwV1-TJOIocGsq7i8MFwEnlKf02gg7LaB9Q&oe=6A8EDF83"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "724629803656108", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303198_724629806989441_9037091471697535725_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=blENO6SkLu0Q7kNvwGZ7l2Y&_nc_oc=AdqhbKahh2XqXYUwgwHoNCNaSdKNiEl1GyfMtEXcGympGrRRz2C9PdQ7NHXlMP4hCFk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEiXi5zN0e0fhWXsL3FpzuS-m4X1JIlNJGkkUxsd2CumA&oe=6A8ECE4E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "555738367475449", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_555738370808782_4745762157325174194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lb1sVv625cQ7kNvwHZSrcg&_nc_oc=AdqvqcqxF8l_FkiubEP7e5dV4cCNPBnKPiesB0mG4B_yyMgWdSoRI3kGZmj0XhYKXZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpKkWbtOtuTKiFUJgHb9nOwuZK017CGAQOaFLAXDK_nA&oe=6A8ECDEB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AphX", "keywords": ["chimp", "monke", "physics", "sandbox", "physix"], "long_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Zero, Aphx is a physics based gorilla-tag style movement game which you can build stuff, or just mess around. \n\nUse the AphX Tablet to control the entire game!\nJust from the AphX Tablet alone, you can:\n- Select items to spawn\n- Adjust color\n- Adjust cosmetics\n- Adjust movement style\n- Get help\n- Go through a tutorial\n\nAnd more to come!\n\nThank you XORWIRE Games for making this possible.", "short_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Z